## 17) File Usage Protocol
Before any task:
1. Read this file.
2. Identify which package the change belongs to.
3. Verify dependency direction is allowed.
4. Ensure business rules stay in `domain`.
5. Ensure shared contracts stay in `shared`.

If speed conflicts with architecture, prioritize architecture.
